(7625568, 1235744, 98565, '<td valign="top">petal heart<br/> <br/> <br/>This reminds me of a children rhyme...translated to English there are no rhymes left, but the meaning is still nice.<br/>Want to hear it?<br/> <br/>The elephant is strong and big<br/>but he is of a delicate disposition<br/>his heart is made of creamy quark<br/>his soul blossoms like a violet.<br/>One day the heavy elephant<br/>stepped on the directors hand<br/>of course it was an accident<br/>they both were melted in tears</td>', 'petal heart  This reminds me of a children rhyme...translated to English there are no rhymes left, but the meaning is still nice.Want to hear it? The elephant is strong and bigbut he is of a delicate dispositionhis heart is made of creamy quarkhis soul blossoms like a violet.One day the heavy elephantstepped on the directors handof course it was an accidentthey both were melted in tears', '2019-04-22 18:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
