(7626200, 1235817, 30982, '<td valign="top">"Oblivious"  This makes me laugh.  The gent in red seems totally obvlivious to the woman in the truck - he''s even missed a belt loop.  And I have no idea what she''s doing.  Fun shot to enter for this challenge.</td>', '"Oblivious"  This makes me laugh.  The gent in red seems totally obvlivious to the woman in the truck - he''s even missed a belt loop.  And I have no idea what she''s doing.  Fun shot to enter for this challenge.', '2019-04-23 21:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7626201, 1235784, 30982, '<td valign="top">"The Twilight Zone"</td>', '"The Twilight Zone"', '2019-04-23 21:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7626202, 1235551, 30982, '<td valign="top">"Hello, Gorgeous!"  What a sweet shot.  Hope the little guy stopped before he drowned in the puddle!</td>', '"Hello, Gorgeous!"  What a sweet shot.  Hope the little guy stopped before he drowned in the puddle!', '2019-04-23 21:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
