(7626204, 1235643, 30982, '<td valign="top">"Tethered"  I enjoy the peeling paint and the color - especially the touches of yellow.</td>', '"Tethered"  I enjoy the peeling paint and the color - especially the touches of yellow.', '2019-04-23 21:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7626205, 1235802, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is, for reasons I cannot explain, my favorite photograph of the challenge.  I did very much enjoy some of the others for the titles they inspired.  But this one - I have tried for two days to come up with a title.  I kinda like the one you have "YNI".  So with that, I have "You''re Not Insane".  I kinda like that one.  Or maybe "Don''t Cut Off Your Toes".  Or perhaps just "Today".  But YNI works just fine, too.</td>', 'This is, for reasons I cannot explain, my favorite photograph of the challenge.  I did very much enjoy some of the others for the titles they inspired.  But this one - I have tried for two days to come up with a title.  I kinda like the one you have "YNI".  So with that, I have "You''re Not Insane".  I kinda like that one.  Or maybe "Don''t Cut Off Your Toes".  Or perhaps just "Today".  But YNI works just fine, too.', '2019-04-23 21:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
