(7626319, 1235567, 98565, '<td valign="top">It''s funny:<br/>Although this is one of the pictures I gave my highest vote I can''t come up with a title which does this beautifuf situation justice. It''s so full of good mood, joy, confidence, friendship...<br/>I''d love to title it "joie de vivre" but it''s still more - since there is a purpose in their joy. I think they are laughing because spectators are cheering them</td>', 'It''s funny:Although this is one of the pictures I gave my highest vote I can''t come up with a title which does this beautifuf situation justice. It''s so full of good mood, joy, confidence, friendship...I''d love to title it "joie de vivre" but it''s still more - since there is a purpose in their joy. I think they are laughing because spectators are cheering them', '2019-04-24 08:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
