(7627673, 1235802, 123833, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> Thanks for all the fun titles suggested.<br/> <br/>This one is my favourite, for its (presumably unintended) irony and for its own internal contradiction, which are both qualities I aspire to in all my photographs:<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by marnet:</b></div><hr/><i> DQ? (initials not allowed?) </i></td></tr></table> </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I didn''t realize that it was allowed to use acronym, sorry<br/> <br/>Edit - Actually, I just re-read the description and You Name It wasn''t necessary either! My fault<br/> <br/>I liked the triangular composition and the air of mystery. My title would have been - Cracks in the Time Space Continuum<br/> <br/>Congrats on TT<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-04-29 06:07:08.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: Thanks for all the fun titles suggested. This one is my favourite, for its (presumably unintended) irony and for its own internal contradiction, which are both qualities I aspire to in all my photographs:Originally posted by marnet: DQ? (initials not allowed?)   I didn''t realize that it was allowed to use acronym, sorry Edit - Actually, I just re-read the description and You Name It wasn''t necessary either! My fault I liked the triangular composition and the air of mystery. My title would have been - Cracks in the Time Space Continuum Congrats on TT', '2019-04-29 06:53:12.000000', '2019-04-29 07:07:08.000000', 0),
(7627675, 1235567, 123833, '<td valign="top">So what were they doing? Why dressed like that? It is not the end of the school year in Perth :)<br/> <br/>Congrats on TT</td>', 'So what were they doing? Why dressed like that? It is not the end of the school year in Perth :) Congrats on TT', '2019-04-29 07:08:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7627676, 1235802, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by marnet:</b></div><hr/><i>  My title would have been - Cracks in the Time Space Continuum</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Cracks in the Time Space Continuum.  Thats now my new favourite!  Thank you.</td>', 'Originally posted by marnet:  My title would have been - Cracks in the Time Space Continuum  Cracks in the Time Space Continuum.  Thats now my new favourite!  Thank you.', '2019-04-29 07:49:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7627679, 1235567, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by marnet:</b></div><hr/><i> So what were they doing? Why dressed like that? It is not the end of the school year in Perth :)<br/> <br/>Congrats on TT </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>After a concert.</td>', 'Originally posted by marnet: So what were they doing? Why dressed like that? It is not the end of the school year in Perth :) Congrats on TT   After a concert.', '2019-04-29 07:53:36.000000', NULL, 0),
