(7627696, 1235647, 138630, '<td valign="top">My 10 - like <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat</a>, there was never any doubt in my mind.  As for the 1, I''m betting that is a result of the old scoring with the keypad thing where an intended 10 gets recorded as a 1 and the voter doesn''t notice.  Unless that voter spots it now and tells you, you''ll never know, though.</td>', 'My 10 - like  Neat, there was never any doubt in my mind.  As for the 1, I''m betting that is a result of the old scoring with the keypad thing where an intended 10 gets recorded as a 1 and the voter doesn''t notice.  Unless that voter spots it now and tells you, you''ll never know, though.', '2019-04-29 11:12:31.000000', NULL, 0),
